# gosu is a pre-compiled Go binary shipped by the upstream postgres:16-alpine image.
# It is NOT used by any of our backup scripts (we run as the postgres user directly).
# These CVEs are in the Go stdlib version gosu was compiled with; fixing them requires
# rebuilding gosu from a newer Go toolchain — something only the upstream postgres
# maintainers can do. Risk: accepted (unused binary, non-root container).
